/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Blueprint Class: BP_EmergencyPhoneBooth
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/Roadside/BP_EmergencyPhoneBooth
Target Parent: AActor
Description:
   Highway SOS emergency roadside telephone call box placed along outer shoulders.
   Features solar power panel, high-visibility safety orange powder coat,
   and pulsing blue LED strobe beacon.
================================================================================

COMPONENT HIERARCHY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- DefaultSceneRoot (SceneComponent)
  ├── BoothHousingMesh (StaticMeshComponent)
  │     - Mesh: SM_Emergency_Phone_Kiosk (80 x 80 x 220 cm)
  │     - BaseColor: Safety Orange (#FF6B00)
  │     - Material: M_PhoneBooth_Orange_PBR
  │
  ├── SolarPanelMesh (StaticMeshComponent)
  │     - Mesh: SM_Solar_Photovoltaic_Mount (60 x 40 x 5 cm)
  │     - Relative Location: (0.0, 0.0, 240.0)
  │     - Relative Rotation: Pitch -35.0 deg (Tilted toward south sun)
  │
  ├── BlueBeaconLight (PointLightComponent)
  │     - Relative Location: (0.0, 0.0, 255.0)
  │     - LightColor: (20, 120, 255) [High-intensity emergency blue]
  │     - Intensity: 3,500 Lumens
  │     - AttenuationRadius: 800 cm
  │
  └── Audio_SOS_Chirp (AudioComponent)
        - Sound: SFX_Emergency_Phone_Standby_Pulse
        - AttenuationSettings: Attenuation_Roadside_ShortRange (400 cm)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EVENT GRAPH RUNTIME TICK:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Event Tick(DeltaTime):
   BeaconTimer += DeltaTime * 2.0;
   float StrobeIntensity = (sin(BeaconTimer * 6.28) > 0.7) ? 8000.0f : 100.0f;
   BlueBeaconLight->SetIntensity(StrobeIntensity);
================================================================================
